i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JMqx7Qq7sE8Q7kNvwF155M4&_nc_oc=AdoSrLKUjcrKdQKl0m69G6_6mIuBbVDj5HtJqqD04wlmtGFz4VSclm8zwjh18RiBisM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTI91dMMIev2N7OC1uirv-iU_Hn0QwNIOXiWn8Ib2Bixw&oe=6AECB863"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XzsEHSFfs44Q7kNvwEJO6g3&_nc_oc=AdqFaaPW_kiaqrIX75FASlklRg9dPxx-pYK6F5BHrQtOyrHC3rHC-6GU0ehqMZcA5lk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTvRt6ZBQcHvjqN2yQjuqXSMSWhII1ltMetplKmY1y1Tw&oe=6AECA45D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=drcbhVvJC0sQ7kNvwHX7rbw&_nc_oc=AdoScJPXt2P_3ytZ51lBR7g67R86d0PpiXsXjUvUNF38wSYrmidyTuiJYm8BCK7q-XA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSkLeDCh1yVa5edP_WhKIJsWtmfLAxtLGTYxxtzsm5RBQ&oe=6AEC92CA"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im